OL,3,AJury out in train stabbing attempted
OL,4,Amurder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors have been sent out to begin
OL,7,Fconsidering their verdicts in the trial
OL,8,Fof a knifeman accused of attempting to
OL,9,Fmurder 10 people on a London-bound
OL,10,Ftrain.
OL,12,FAnthony Williams, 33, denies attempting
OL,13,Fto murder the 10 passengers he stabbed
OL,14,Fbetween Peterborough and Huntingdon,
OL,15,FCambridgeshire, on 1 November 2025.
OL,17,FHe has also pleaded not guilty to the
OL,18,Fattempted murders of three people in
OL,19,FPeterborough and a boy in London prior
OL,20,Fto the stabbings.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
