OL,3,AJury out in train stabbing attempted
OL,4,Amurder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter summing up the evidence in the
OL,7,Fcase, the judge, Mr Justice Calver KC,
OL,8,Fsent the jury at Cambridge Crown Court
OL,9,Fout to start their deliberations.
